Hi,

Our next Open Printing call will be *next* Wednesday on 11 January.

Minutes from our last OP call are archived at:

ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/minutes/OP-Minutes-20111109.htm


Agenda:

(1) OP Logistics - Status of LF Infrastructure (Till Kamppeter)

(2) Status of Common Printing Dialog (Lars Uebernickel)

(3) Status of Common Mobile Print Client (Glen Petrie)

(4) Planning for Open Printing Summit (Till, Ira)
     - joint meeting w/ PWG at Apple 23-27 April 2012
     - selected PWG topics will be reordered for OP joint sessions
     - key OP topics?

(5) PWG Highlights for Open Printing (Ira McDonald)
     - PWG meeting on 6-8 December at Dell in Austin, TX

Dial-in information:

January 2012 - US/Europe - OP Monthly Meeting

    - Wednesday 11 January 2012, Daytime
      - US
        9am in San Francisco - US PST (Pacific Standard Time)
        10am in Colorado - US MST (Mountain Standard Time)
        11am in Chicago - US CST (Central Standard Time)
        12pm in New York - US EST (Eastern Standard Time)
      - Europe
        6pm in Berlin - CET (Central European Time)

    * Main Number (Till Kamppeter, LF, leader)
      International: +1-218-936-7999
      Access Code:   491659#

